PN,31201
SC,0001
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786961910
OL,3,CIsrael's Ben-Gvir suggests killing '30
OL,4,Cto 40' people in Gaza nightly on
OL,5,Cpodcast
OL,7,FIsrael's National Security Minister
OL,8,FItamar Ben-Gvir publicly advocated
OL,9,Fkilling "30 to 40" people in Gaza each
OL,10,Fnight in comments made in a podcast
OL,11,Fhosted by a former Israeli hostage.
OL,13,FBen-Gvir, a member of Prime Minister
OL,14,FBenjamin Netanyahu's coalition
OL,15,Fcabinet, made the remarks on Rom
OL,16,FBraslavski's podcast while discussing
OL,17,FIsrael's recovery from Hamas' attack
OL,18,Fon October 7, 2023.
OL,26,@qD@IOUqD@RO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786961910
OL,3,CIsrael's Ben-Gvir suggests killing '30
OL,4,Cto 40' people in Gaza nightly on
OL,5,Cpodcast
OL,7,FCriticising a recent reduction of
OL,8,FIsraeli airstrikes in Gaza, the lawyer
OL,9,Fand politician said: "It's no secret,
OL,10,FI disagree with the prime minister.
OL,12,F"I think targeted assassinations
OL,13,Fshould be carried out in Gaza, taking
OL,14,Fdown 30 to 40 every night. Not just
OL,15,Fthose who pose an immediate threat `
OL,16,Fthere are people there who are not
OL,17,Fworthy of life. They shouldn't live.
OL,18,FThey're not even people."
OL,26,@qD@VOUtD@AOUzD@YO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
