PN,31203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786961910
OL,3,CIsrael's Ben-Gvir suggests killing '30
OL,4,Cto 40' people in Gaza nightly on
OL,5,Cpodcast
OL,7,FSimilar statements have been made in
OL,8,Fthe past by Ben-Gvir and other Israeli
OL,9,Fofficials, many of which have been
OL,10,Fpresented to the United Nation's world
OL,11,Fcourt as evidence of genocidal intent
OL,12,Fagainst the Palestinians.
OL,14,FIsrael denies that it has committed
OL,15,Fgenocide in Gaza.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
