PN,31204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786961910
OL,3,CIsrael's Ben-Gvir suggests killing '30
OL,4,Cto 40' people in Gaza nightly on
OL,5,Cpodcast
OL,7,FBen-Gvir, leader of Israel's far-right
OL,8,FOtzma Yehudit (Jewish Power) party,
OL,9,Fhas served as Israel's national
OL,10,Fsecurity minister since 2022 as part
OL,11,Fof a coalition deal with Netanyahu's
OL,12,FLikud party.
OL,14,FFigures like Ben-Gvir have become more
OL,15,Fpopular among Israelis since Hamas'
OL,16,Fbrutal attack in 2023, which saw
OL,17,Fmilitants kill around 1,200 people and
OL,18,Ftake 251 hostages.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786961910
OL,3,CIsrael's Ben-Gvir suggests killing '30
OL,4,Cto 40' people in Gaza nightly on
OL,5,Cpodcast
OL,7,FMany hostages have recounted long-term
OL,8,Fstarvation, physical and psychological
OL,9,Fabuse and, in some cases, sexual abuse.
OL,11,FBen-Gvir does not have power over the
OL,12,Fcountry's military and cannot order
OL,13,Fstrikes on Gaza. But, after operating
OL,14,Ffor decades within Israel's far-right
OL,15,Ffringe, he is now one of the most
OL,16,Finfluential people in the country.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
