PN,31206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786961910
OL,3,CIsrael's Ben-Gvir suggests killing '30
OL,4,Cto 40' people in Gaza nightly on
OL,5,Cpodcast
OL,7,FHe has substantial control over key
OL,8,Fparts of Israel's security apparatus,
OL,9,Frunning the country's prisons ` where
OL,10,Fthousands of Palestinians from Gaza
OL,11,Fand the West Bank are incarcerated `
OL,12,Fas well as the national police force.
OL,14,FHe has previously boasted of lessening
OL,15,Ffood rations for Palestinian
OL,16,Fprisoners. Israel's top court ruled in
OL,17,F2025 that the prison service under Ben-
OL,18,FGvir was depriving Palestinians of a
OL,19,Fminimum subsistence diet.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
