PN,31207
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786961910
OL,3,CIsrael's Ben-Gvir suggests killing '30
OL,4,Cto 40' people in Gaza nightly on
OL,5,Cpodcast
OL,7,FUntil recently, Israel was striking
OL,8,FGaza nearly every day, attacks that
OL,9,Fhave killed over 1,250 people since an
OL,10,FOctober truce deal came into effect,
OL,11,Faccording to Gaza's Health Ministry.
OL,13,FIsrael's military, which says the
OL,14,Fstrikes have targeted Hamas militants,
OL,15,Fappeared to ease off on the attacks in
OL,16,Fa quiet concession to US President
OL,17,FDonald Trump after Netanyahu rejected
OL,18,Fthe president's latest attempt to move
OL,19,Fthe truce forward.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
