PN,31208
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786961910
OL,3,CIsrael's Ben-Gvir suggests killing '30
OL,4,Cto 40' people in Gaza nightly on
OL,5,Cpodcast
OL,7,FIsraeli media last week reported that
OL,8,Fthe authority for carrying out strikes
OL,9,Fhas now been limited to the army's
OL,10,Fchief of staff, raising the ire of
OL,11,Fright-wing lawmakers such as Ben-Gvir.
OL,13,FIn the same podcast appearance, the
OL,14,Flawmaker advocated for mass emigration
OL,15,Fof Palestinians from Gaza ` a proposal
OL,16,Fthat international lawyers say could
OL,17,Famount to ethnic cleansing ` and
OL,18,Fresettlement of Gaza by Israel.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
