PN,31209
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786961910
OL,3,CIsrael's Ben-Gvir suggests killing '30
OL,4,Cto 40' people in Gaza nightly on
OL,5,Cpodcast
OL,7,FIsrael withdrew from the Gaza Strip 20
OL,8,Fyears ago, dismantling a block of 21
OL,9,FJewish settlements known as "Gush
OL,10,FKatif" and pulling out its forces.
OL,12,FSince the most recent war, Israel now
OL,13,Fcontrols 60-70% of Gaza having
OL,14,Festablished a so-called "yellow line",
OL,15,Fhaving pushed beyond a boundary agreed
OL,16,Funder a ceasefire deal.
OL,18,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,19,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,20,Fcoverage from ITV Wales, sent direct
OL,21,Fto your inbox every Saturday morning.
