PN,31210
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786961910
OL,3,CIsrael's Ben-Gvir suggests killing '30
OL,4,Cto 40' people in Gaza nightly on
OL,5,Cpodcast
OL,7,F"I see all of Gaza as ours," said Ben-
OL,8,FGvir said during the interview.
OL,9,F"Settlements not just in Gush Katif
OL,10,Fbut throughout Gaza, encouraging as
OL,11,Fmuch emigration as possible, sending
OL,12,Fthem to their countries, and for the
OL,13,Fterrorists, no emigration, nothing,
OL,14,Fjust to kill them one by one."
OL,16,FTrump's latest proposal involves Hamas
OL,17,Fgradually giving up its weapons while
OL,18,FIsraeli forces halt their attacks and
OL,19,Fbegin withdrawing from Gaza.
OL,26,@oD@AOUoD@\O]qD@AOUvD@^O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/12
