PN,31211
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786961910
OL,3,CIsrael's Ben-Gvir suggests killing '30
OL,4,Cto 40' people in Gaza nightly on
OL,5,Cpodcast
OL,7,FHamas accepted the deal, although the
OL,8,Fgroup linked the surrender of its
OL,9,Fheaviest weapons to the creation of a
OL,10,FPalestinian state, something Israel's
OL,11,Fcurrent government and most of its
OL,12,Fpolitical class adamantly reject.
OL,14,FNetanyahu says Israel will not retreat
OL,15,Ffrom any of its positions in Gaza
OL,16,Funtil Hamas has been completely
OL,17,Fdisarmed.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/12
