OL,3,CIsrael's Ben-Gvir suggests killing '30
OL,4,Cto 40' people in Gaza nightly on
OL,5,Cpodcast
OL,7,FThe stance leaves other elements of
OL,8,Fthe ceasefire, including the
OL,9,Fdeployment of international forces and
OL,10,Fany reconstruction of the devastated
OL,11,Fterritory, on hold.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/12
